      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Gang AU. Catra is a badass with a past. Glimmer is cute. Adora is a traitor. Bow is complicit with the traitor-ness. Shadow Weaver is a terrible person, but that's not new. Angella is austere and scary as hell. Scorpia helps. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AKA, Catra protects her own. No matter what.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
